WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
Dakedo ki ni naru

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.554
Kinou yori mo zutto...

00:00:17.956 --> 00:00:21.187
Togireta yume. ..

00:00:21.326 --> 00:00:24.818
Futari no tsuzukiga shiritai!

00:00:31.169 --> 00:00:36.402
Ah, kami—sama...
jikan o... tomete yo

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:43.006
Kyou kasho...seifuku...
mada kami, kawakanai...

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, tasukete...
ribbon ga kimaranai...

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
Aitsu no yume mita sei... yo

00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:01.296
Koge—kake no toast kajitara...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
Naze ka fui ni...
mune ga tokimeita...

00:01:10.676 --> 00:01:15.579
Amakute nigai. . .marmalade

00:01:15.714 --> 00:01:18.148
Dakara ki ni naru...

00:01:18.684 --> 00:01:20.709
Konna kimochi wa naze?

00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:23.950
Ima ichiban...

00:01:25.424 --> 00:01:28.951
Aitsu no egao ni aitai!

00:02:37.596 --> 00:02:45.526
MISUNDERSTANDINGS —
"MY BOYFRIEND IS YUU, BUT..."

00:11:10.008 --> 00:11:11.999
MARMALADE BOY

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.378
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:11.435 --> 00:22:12.402
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.791 --> 00:22:36.760
MISSING EACH OTHER —
"I'M SO LONELY,
I CAN'T TAKE IT ANYMORE."

00:22:52.376 --> 00:22:56.904
Kokoro ga arawareru

00:22:57.047 --> 00:23:02.280
Hikari wo mitsuketa

00:23:02.419 --> 00:23:07.015
Mezamete iku sora ni

00:23:07.157 --> 00:23:12.618
Anata ga kagayaku no

00:23:12.763 --> 00:23:17.700
Donna ni tooku

00:23:17.835 --> 00:23:22.795
Hanarete ite mo

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:27.809
Onnaji yoake wo

00:23:27.945 --> 00:23:33.315
Mukaete iru no ne

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:38.080
Mabushiku kirameku no

00:23:38.222 --> 00:23:43.524
Omoide wo musubu ito

00:23:43.661 --> 00:23:48.724
Mirai no mirai ni mo

00:23:48.866 --> 00:23:53.894
Kamisama ga itekureru

00:23:54.038 --> 00:24:00.307
Kamisama ga itekureru
